{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024093932107-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024121439\"/><p>高雄發生極淺層地震。</p><p>台灣周六（24日）在5小時內發生3次地震，其中高雄於上午9時25分發生黎克特制4級地震，震源深度僅5公里，屬於極淺層地震。震央位於高雄市桃源區，最大震度4級，共7縣市有感。</p><p>台灣東部海域周六凌晨4時48分和58分另發生4.8級和5級地震，震央距離花蓮縣政府東南偏東方30.4公里和31.2公里，震源深度分別為15.4公里和16.8公里。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:24:29.402918+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:39:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:18:14.788252+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T04:18:29.811908+00:00","content_hash":"940d01b40940e339ea697fac9515da4776c79ad005abd5ff547f6f8b44bb1b10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}